summary: Verify unsigned packages are rejected
description: >-
  Reject an unsigned package through the shipped Azure Linux repository configuration
test: ./test.sh
duration: 5m
require+:
- azurelinux-repos
- dnf5
- createrepo_c
- rpm-build
extra-azurelinux-test:
  scenario: pkg:azurelinux-repos/reject-untrusted-packages
